---
// The home page, drawn as a botanical plate: a numbered plate for each app,
// then the latest notes. The look is in src/styles/paper.css and home.css.
import { formatDate, getPosts, isoDate } from '../lib/content';
import '../styles/paper.css';
import '../styles/home.css';

const notes = (await getPosts()).slice(0, 3);
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>MTWABP In</title>
<meta name="description" content="MTWABP In makes apps for everyday life: Grove, a habit tracker where your habits grow a living valley, and Kolahal, a keyboard-first terminal launcher for Android.">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#F2EAD8" media="(prefers-color-scheme: light)">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#1C1612" media="(prefers-color-scheme: dark)">
<link rel="icon" href="images/favicon.svg" type="image/svg+xml">
<link rel="icon" href="images/favicon-32.png" type="image/png" sizes="32x32">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="images/mtwabp-180.png">
<link rel="manifest" href="site.webmanifest">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="MTWABP In">
<meta property="og:title" content="MTWABP In">
<meta property="og:description" content="Apps for everyday life: Grove and Kolahal.">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://mtwabpin.github.io/">
<meta property="og:image" content="https://mtwabpin.github.io/images/mtwabp-share.jpg">
<meta property="og:image:width" content="1200">
<meta property="og:image:height" content="630">
<meta property="og:image:alt" content="MTWABP In, Make the world a better place, with an engraved sprig, and the icons of Grove and Kolahal.">
<meta name="twitter:card" content="summary_large_image">
<link rel="preload" href="fonts/IMFellEnglishSC.woff2" as="font" type="font/woff2" crossorigin>
<link rel="alternate" type="application/rss+xml" title="MTWABP In" href="/rss.xml">
</head>
<body>

<div class="frame">
  <header class="title">
    <img class="emblem" src="images/mtwabp-emblem.svg" width="140" height="182" alt="">
    <h1>MTWABP In</h1>
    <p class="motto">Make the world a better place</p>
    <div class="fleuron" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 88 C28 70 26 34 50 12 C74 34 72 70 50 88Z" fill="#7FA05A" class="ln" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M50 92 L50 22" class="ln" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M50 62 L36 50 M50 62 L64 50 M50 44 L40 35 M50 44 L60 35" class="ln" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span></span></div>
    <p class="intro">MTWABP In makes apps for everyday life.</p>
  </header>

  <main>
    <ul class="plates" aria-label="Our apps">
      <li class="plate">
        <div class="plate-head"><span>Plate I.</span><span>A habit tracker</span></div>
        <figure>
          <img src="images/plate-grove.svg" width="300" height="180" alt="An engraving of a seed in the soil, a sprout, a young plant and a sapling, each with its roots.">
          <figcaption><i>Figs. 1–4.</i> From seed to sapling, as a habit grows day by day.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="name">
          <img src="grove/images/grove-icon.png" width="192" height="192" alt="">
          <div>
            <h2>Grove</h2>
            <span class="status"><svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><g class="ln" stroke-width=".7" fill="#D58A8A"><ellipse cx="10" cy="5.2" rx="3" ry="4.4"/><ellipse cx="10" cy="5.2" rx="3" ry="4.4" transform="rotate(72 10 10)"/><ellipse cx="10" cy="5.2" rx="3" ry="4.4" transform="rotate(144 10 10)"/><ellipse cx="10" cy="5.2" rx="3" ry="4.4" transform="rotate(216 10 10)"/><ellipse cx="10" cy="5.2" rx="3" ry="4.4" transform="rotate(288 10 10)"/></g><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="2.4" fill="#E2B04A" class="ln" stroke-width=".7"/></svg> On Google Play</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>Grow a living valley from your habits. Build good ones and let go of the rest.</p>
        <p class="go"><a href="grove/"><svg class="ic" width="34" height="17" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6.5h7v11H2z" fill="var(--sheet)" class="ln" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M4.3 7v10M6.6 7v10" class="fn" stroke-width=".5"/><path d="M9 8c4-2.4 9.5-2.2 13.5-.6H43.5c3 0 3 5 0 5H27c1.4 1.4 1.2 3.4-.4 4.1 1.1 1.3.4 3.6-1.6 3.6H14c-3 0-5-1.6-5-4z" fill="var(--sheet)" class="ln" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M22.5 12.4h4.3M24.6 16.6h2M14 13.5c2 .3 3.4 1 4 2.2" class="fn" stroke-width=".6" fill="none"/></svg> Visit Grove</a></p>
      </li>
      <li class="plate">
        <div class="plate-head"><span>Plate II.</span><span>A launcher</span></div>
        <figure>
          <img src="images/plate-kolahal.svg" width="220" height="175" alt="An engraving of a fern frond, and a young frond still curled.">
          <figcaption><i>Fig. 1.</i> A frond. <i>Fig. 2.</i> A young one, still unfurling.</figcaption>
        </figure>
        <div class="name">
          <img src="images/kolahal-icon.svg" width="48" height="48" alt="">
          <div>
            <h2>Kolahal</h2>
            <span class="status"><svg class="ic" width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 20 20" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M10 19V11" class="ln" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M10 11c-4-1.5-4.5-6 0-9.5 4.5 3.5 4 8 0 9.5z" fill="#D58A8A" class="ln" stroke-width=".8"/><path d="M10 12c-3 0-5-1.4-5.5-3.4M10 12c3 0 5-1.4 5.5-3.4" fill="none" class="ln" stroke-width=".8"/></svg> In testing</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <p>A keyboard-first terminal launcher for Android. Type a few letters to open an app or run a command.</p>
        <p class="go"><a href="kolahal/"><svg class="ic" width="34" height="17" viewBox="0 0 48 24" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M2 6.5h7v11H2z" fill="var(--sheet)" class="ln" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M4.3 7v10M6.6 7v10" class="fn" stroke-width=".5"/><path d="M9 8c4-2.4 9.5-2.2 13.5-.6H43.5c3 0 3 5 0 5H27c1.4 1.4 1.2 3.4-.4 4.1 1.1 1.3.4 3.6-1.6 3.6H14c-3 0-5-1.6-5-4z" fill="var(--sheet)" class="ln" stroke-width="1" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M22.5 12.4h4.3M24.6 16.6h2M14 13.5c2 .3 3.4 1 4 2.2" class="fn" stroke-width=".6" fill="none"/></svg> Visit Kolahal</a></p>
      </li>
    </ul>

    {
      notes.length > 0 && (
        <section class="notes" aria-labelledby="notes">
          <div class="fleuron" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 88 C28 70 26 34 50 12 C74 34 72 70 50 88Z" fill="#7FA05A" class="ln" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M50 92 L50 22" class="ln" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M50 62 L36 50 M50 62 L64 50 M50 44 L40 35 M50 44 L60 35" class="ln" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span></span></div>
          <h2 id="notes">From the notebook</h2>
          <ol>
            {notes.map((post) => (
              <li>
                <a href={`/posts/${post.id}/`}>{post.data.title}</a>
                <time datetime={isoDate(post.data.date)}>{formatDate(post.data.date)}</time>
              </li>
            ))}
          </ol>
          <p class="all"><a href="/posts/">All notes</a></p>
        </section>
      )
    }
  </main>

  <footer>
    <div class="fleuron" aria-hidden="true"><span></span><svg class="ic" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 100 100"><path d="M50 88 C28 70 26 34 50 12 C74 34 72 70 50 88Z" fill="#7FA05A" class="ln" stroke-width="5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M50 92 L50 22" class="ln" stroke-width="4.5" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M50 62 L36 50 M50 62 L64 50 M50 44 L40 35 M50 44 L60 35" class="ln" stroke-width="3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span></span></div>
    <p><svg class="ic" width="22" height="17" viewBox="0 0 32 24" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="1.5" y="2.5" width="29" height="19" rx="1" fill="var(--sheet)" class="ln" stroke-width="1"/><path d="M1.5 3l14.5 11L30.5 3M1.5 21.5l11-9M30.5 21.5l-11-9" fill="none" class="ln" stroke-width="1"/><circle cx="16" cy="14" r="3.6" fill="#A8402F"/></svg> <span>Questions or ideas? Write to <a href="mailto:mtwabpin@gmail.com">mtwabpin@gmail.com</a>.</span></p>
    <p>&copy; 2026 MTWABP In</p>
  </footer>
</div>


<script>
  import { setUpOffline } from '../scripts/offline';

  setUpOffline();
</script>
</body>
</html>
